    // can REJECT any Latin-bearing candidate on Arabic pages. The bug
    // that motivated this: `geocodeSlug()` resolves small French towns
    // via Nominatim WITHOUT `name:ar`, so `loadCityData` ends up
    // writing `currentCity = 'Le Pontet'` (English). Without the
    // guard, _syncCityNameInDom would then swap the correct SSR name
    // "لو بونت" with "Le Pontet" everywhere — including <title>,
    // <h1>, FAQ, JSON-LD. The Latin guard ensures Arabic pages NEVER
    // accept a goodName containing Latin letters; the SSR name stays.
    //
